      "description": "<p>Feature Added:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimal Stamina Bars</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Feature Removed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backpack Inaccessible on Shoulders. Will be its own mod “Restricted Backpack”.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fixed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Map title in loading screen anchor.</li>\n<li>Ammo icon opacity.</li>\n<li>Skip Pre-Raid Menus now less jank nor FIKA dependent. Moved out of beta. Still don’t use the ESC button at the Raid Ready screen though.</li>\n<li>Mod GUID for Forge verification.</li>\n</ul>\n",
